title: Pan and zoom with no code
intro: Camera Controls lets the player pan around a big level and zoom toward the mouse, and the HUD keeps its size and place.

project: Empty | Camera Controls

chapter: A level bigger than the screen | Camera Controls on the camera
create: Tilemap
rename: Level
set: Tilemap.Tiles = 111122221111222211112222111122221111\n111122221111222211112222111122221111\n111122221111222211112222111122221111\n111122221111222211112222111122221111\n222211112222111122221111222211112222\n222211112222111122221111222211112222\n222211112222111122221111222211112222\n222211112222111122221111222211112222\n111122221111222211112222111122221111\n111122221111222211112222111122221111\n111122221111222211112222111122221111\n111122221111222211112222111122221111\n222211112222111122221111222211112222\n222211112222111122221111222211112222\n222211112222111122221111222211112222\n222211112222111122221111222211112222\n111122221111222211112222111122221111\n111122221111222211112222111122221111
deselect
select: Main Camera
set: Camera.Size = 5
add: CameraControls
explain: component:CameraControls | Camera Controls | Camera Controls on the camera lets the player pan and zoom with no code: the arrow keys and W A S D pan, the middle or right mouse button drags the world along, and the wheel zooms toward the mouse.
pick: CameraControls.StayInside = Level
explain: field:CameraControls.StayInside | Stay Inside | Stay Inside keeps the view inside the level, and it's read every frame, so a level that grows lets the view go further.
explain: field:CameraControls.ZoomMax | Zoom limits | The wheel zooms between Zoom Min and Zoom Max, the camera's smallest and largest size.

chapter: A HUD that doesn't zoom | Hud Size keeps it the size it was laid out at
set: Camera.HudSize = 5
deselect
create: Text
rename: Cash
set: Text.Value = Cash: 120
add: ScreenAnchor
set: ScreenAnchor.Offset = 1.5, -0.6
say: The cash readout is pinned to the top left, and the camera's Hud Size says the HUD was laid out at size five.

chapter: Play | Pan, drag and zoom
play
hold: Right 1.5
hold: Down 1
say: The arrow keys pan, and the view stops at the level's edge.
hold: Right 2
wheel: game = down 3
say: The wheel zooms out toward the mouse. The world gets smaller, and the cash readout stays the same size in its corner.
wheel: game = up 4
stop
